Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,《Royals》\NLorde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a diamond in the flesh\N♪ 我从未见过真钻石 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut my teeth on wedding rings in the movies\N♪ 我在电影里才初次见到结婚戒指 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not proud of my address\N♪ 我并不为我的住址感到骄傲 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In a torn - up town\N♪ 在这个破败的小镇 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,no post code envy\N♪ 没人会羡慕这里的邮编 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But every song's like gold teeth, grey goose, trippin' in the bathroom\N♪ 但每首歌里都唱着金牙、美酒、在浴室里飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood stains, ball gowns, trashin' the hotel room\N♪ 血迹、舞会礼服、把酒店房间弄得一团糟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.09,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't care\N♪ 我们不在乎 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're driving Cadillacs in our dreams\N♪ 在梦里我们开着凯迪拉克 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:01:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But everybody's like crystal, Maybach, diamonds on your time piece\N♪ 但每个人都好像戴水晶、开迈巴赫、手表镶钻 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet planes, islands, tigers on a gold leash\N♪ 私人飞机、岛屿、金链拴老虎 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't care, we aren't caught up in your love affair\N♪ 我们不在乎，我们不会陷入你的风流韵事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never be royals\N♪ 我们永远成不了皇室成员 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It don't run in our blood\N♪ 这不是我们与生俱来的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of luxe just ain't for us\N♪ 那种奢华不属于我们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.22,0:01:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We crave a different kind of buzz\N♪ 我们渴望一种不同的刺激 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be your ruler\N♪ 让我做你的统治者 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me queen bee\N♪ 你可以叫我蜂后 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And baby, I'll rule, I'll rule\N♪ 宝贝，我会统治，我会统治 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me live that fantasy\N♪ 让我活在那个幻想中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends and I - we've cracked the code\N♪ 我和我的朋友们 - 我们已经破解了密码 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We count our dollars on the train to the party\N♪ 我们在去派对的火车上数着我们的美元 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And everyone who knows us knows that we're fine with this\N♪ 每个认识我们的人都知道我们对此很满意 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't come for money\N♪ 我们不是为了钱而来 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But every song's like gold teeth, grey goose, trippin' in the bathroom\N♪ 但每首歌里都唱着金牙、美酒、在浴室里飘飘欲仙 ♪
